cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you cite this work, cite the technical report below, and name the commit you measured — figures here are pinned to commits, not to the project."
title: "Tracefold"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Glovrex"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TraceFold/tracefold"
url: "https://glovrex.com"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "Verified undo and offline-verifiable receipts for AI agent actions. An agent's change is held with a checked inverse before it lands, and every verdict becomes a signed receipt anyone can re-check offline, without trusting whoever issued it."
keywords:
  - undo
  - reversibility
  - provenance
  - receipts
  - verification
  - ai-agents
